## The gate (one chained call, exit 0)

```
HEAVY_MIN_AVAIL_MB=1500 bash .../heavy-run.sh -c 'node .../mech-check.mjs paint-splash &&
  ./forge render paint-splash --preset all &&
  ./forge cutout paint-splash --out out/chibi-sprouts/r1/props --ppm 1024 --canvas 1024x1024
    --views front,three-quarter &&
  for p in blue yellow; do ./forge cutout paint-splash --preset $p
    --out out/chibi-sprouts/r1/props/presets/$p --ppm 1024 --canvas 1024x1024
    --views front,three-quarter; done &&
  node scripts/cutout-check.mjs out/chibi-sprouts/r1/props &&
  node scripts/cutout-check.mjs out/chibi-sprouts/r1/props/presets/blue &&
  node scripts/cutout-check.mjs out/chibi-sprouts/r1/props/presets/yellow &&
  python3 scripts/review-cards.py out/prop-cards paint-splash'
```

